{
  "chip_id": "myreturn.year_tax",
  "kind": "accessor",
  "set": "myreturn",
  "label": "My return: the tax of an earlier year - slabs, special rates, 87A, surcharge with marginal relief, cess",
  "aliases": [
    "tax of an earlier year",
    "itr-u tax",
    "form 10e tax",
    "surcharge"
  ],
  "params": [
    {
      "name": "fy",
      "type": "number",
      "default": 2019,
      "label": "the financial year (its first year)"
    },
    {
      "name": "regime",
      "type": "text",
      "default": "old",
      "label": "old / new"
    },
    {
      "name": "band",
      "type": "text",
      "default": "below60",
      "label": "below60 / 60to80 / 80plus that year"
    },
    {
      "name": "resident",
      "type": "boolean",
      "default": true,
      "label": "resident that year (the unused basic exemption against special-rate gains, 87A)"
    },
    {
      "name": "normal",
      "type": "number",
      "default": 0,
      "label": "income at the slab rates"
    },
    {
      "name": "stcg_111a",
      "type": "number",
      "default": 0,
      "label": "short-term gains taxed u/s 111A"
    },
    {
      "name": "ltcg_112a",
      "type": "number",
      "default": 0,
      "label": "long-term gains u/s 112A (before its exemption)"
    },
    {
      "name": "ltcg_112",
      "type": "number",
      "default": 0,
      "label": "long-term gains u/s 112 (after indexation when that year's 112 had it)"
    },
    {
      "name": "special",
      "type": "number",
      "default": 0,
      "label": "income at 30%: 115BB / 115BBJ / 115BBH"
    },
    {
      "name": "early",
      "type": "boolean",
      "default": false,
      "label": "FY 2024-25: the gains were on transfers before 23 July 2024"
    }
  ],
  "expr": {
    "chip": "myreturn.year_tax_s5",
    "args": {
      "fy": "$fy",
      "regime": "$regime",
      "band": "$band",
      "resident": "$resident",
      "normal": "$normal",
      "stcg_111a": "$stcg_111a",
      "ltcg_112a": "$ltcg_112a",
      "ltcg_112": "$ltcg_112",
      "special": "$special",
      "early": "$early",
      "b": {
        "chip": "myreturn.year_tax_s4",
        "args": {
          "fy": "$fy",
          "regime": "$regime",
          "band": "$band",
          "resident": "$resident",
          "normal": "$normal",
          "stcg_111a": "$stcg_111a",
          "ltcg_112a": "$ltcg_112a",
          "ltcg_112": "$ltcg_112",
          "special": "$special",
          "early": "$early",
          "b": {
            "chip": "myreturn.year_tax_s3",
            "args": {
              "fy": "$fy",
              "regime": "$regime",
              "band": "$band",
              "resident": "$resident",
              "normal": "$normal",
              "stcg_111a": "$stcg_111a",
              "ltcg_112a": "$ltcg_112a",
              "ltcg_112": "$ltcg_112",
              "special": "$special",
              "early": "$early",
              "b": {
                "chip": "myreturn.year_tax_s2",
                "args": {
                  "fy": "$fy",
                  "regime": "$regime",
                  "band": "$band",
                  "resident": "$resident",
                  "normal": "$normal",
                  "stcg_111a": "$stcg_111a",
                  "ltcg_112a": "$ltcg_112a",
                  "ltcg_112": "$ltcg_112",
                  "special": "$special",
                  "early": "$early",
                  "b": {
                    "chip": "myreturn.year_tax_s1",
                    "args": {
                      "fy": "$fy",
                      "regime": "$regime",
                      "band": "$band",
                      "resident": "$resident",
                      "normal": "$normal",
                      "stcg_111a": "$stcg_111a",
                      "ltcg_112a": "$ltcg_112a",
                      "ltcg_112": "$ltcg_112",
                      "special": "$special",
                      "early": "$early"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "returns": "record",
  "version": 2,
  "status": "published",
  "description_nl": "2026-10-08: An earlier year's tax as that year's Finance Act had it (chip myreturn.year_rates): the slabs on normal income; a resident's unused basic exemption against the 111A, then 112A (after its exemption), then 112 gains; the special rates; 87A (a resident with total income within the limit; never against 112A tax, s.112A(6); from FY 2025-26 in the new regime only against slab-rate tax) with the new regime's marginal relief from FY 2023-24; the surcharge on the tax - the 111A / 112A / 112 part at most 15% where that year capped it - with marginal relief (tax and surcharge at most the tax at the line plus the income over it, the excess taken off normal income); the cess on both. 2026-10-10: the same expressions in stages (chips myreturn.year_tax_s1 - s5, each reading what the stage before worked out) instead of every field holding a copy of the fields it needs - 1.76 MB on disk to a few dozen KB; answers checked identical on the chip's cases and 20,000 random returns (tools/slim_myreturn_tax.py --check: 2363 s old, 336 s new), about seven times faster.",
